# @hub-lanes

# ── ROADMAP-RENDER LANE (BH-7265, BH-7243.2) ───────────────────────────────
# Daily at 06:41 it renders docs/ROADMAP.html for each project in the
# roadmap.render_projects settings row (empty = none, the seed) from GET
# /api/roadmap/board, compares it with the default branch (the generated-at
# line dropped), and opens or updates ONE PR on roadmap/render-<project>. It
# never writes the default branch and never merges. No model call. flock -n
# dedupes.
# Off: an empty roadmap.render_projects, flags/lane-off-roadmap-render, or
# bin/harness-ctl.sh off roadmap-render.
41 6 * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/roadmap-render.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
